30:["$","p","55",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Avoid transparent PNGs -- they'll show through inverted backgrounds. Instead, use solid-background SVGs or define explicit `background-color` on all containers."]}]
31:["$","p","56",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Never rely solely on color to convey meaning (e.g., \"red = error\"). Add icons or text labels -- required for WCAG 2.2 Success Criterion 1.4.11 (Non-text Contrast)."]}]
