33:["$","h2","60",{"className":"text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-10 mb-4 tracking-tight","children":"♿ 3. Accessibility: The Silent Conversion Driver"}]
34:["$","p","62",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["Only ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"11% of B2B marketers test email accessibility"}],", yet accessible emails see ",["$","strong","3",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"17% higher click-to-open rates"}]," (WebAIM Email Accessibility Report, 2026). Why? Because semantic structure benefits *everyone*: screen reader users, low-vision readers, distracted mobile scrollers -- and even AI-powered email summarizers (like Gmail's \"Smart Summary\")."]}]
35:["$","h3","64",{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-[#FEF2F0] mt-8 mb-3","children":"✅ Actionable Fixes:"}]
36:["$","p","65",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Use ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"real `<h1>`-`<h6>` headings"}],", not styled `<div>`s. Nest them logically -- skip levels only when semantically justified."]}]
37:["$","p","66",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Add `alt` text to *every* image -- but keep it concise (<125 chars) and descriptive (\"Infographic: 2026 SaaS retention benchmarks\", not \"chart.png\")."]}]
38:["$","p","67",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Set `role=\"presentation\"` on layout-only tables to suppress screen reader announcements."]}]
39:["$","p","68",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["- Ensure ",["$","strong","1",{"className":"font-bold text-[#FEF2F0]","children":"minimum contrast ratio of 4.5:1"}]," for body text (use tools like [axe DevTools for Email](https://www.deque.com/axe/devtools/email/) or [WebAIM Contrast Checker](https://webaim.org/resources/contrastchecker/))."]}]
3a:["$","p","70",{"className":"text-[#BE8A83] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-base","children":["> ⚠️ Critical: Never use `display: none` to hide content -- many email clients (including Yahoo! Mail) strip it entirely. Instead, use `aria-hidden=\"true\"` + `visibility: hidden; position: absolute;`."]}]
